      "end_seconds": 5.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "hmm uh hello doctor may I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.82,
      "end_seconds": 10.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Yes have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.66,
      "end_seconds": 20.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.9,
      "text": "Yeah it's chest pain after a crash. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.44,
      "end_seconds": 23.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.23,
      "end_seconds": 38.5,
      "duration_seconds": 13.27,
      "text": "yeah, it's been two months now i thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.77,
      "end_seconds": 43.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "yes carry on rate it for me mild moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.94,
      "end_seconds": 47.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "it, It feels moderate to me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.31,
      "end_seconds": 50.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "have you been feeling faint?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.51,
      "end_seconds": 54.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Mm, uh, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.63,
      "end_seconds": 63.09,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "right, have you had chest pain after a crash before, or is this the the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.94,
      "end_seconds": 73.78,
      "duration_seconds": 8.84,
      "text": "hmm, yes, something like this happened last year, and it went away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.4,
      "end_seconds": 80.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "so, have you noticed neck pain, loss of consciousness or head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.83,
      "end_seconds": 88.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "I mean no no neck pain loss of consciousness or head injury"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.08,
      "end_seconds": 94.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "and your skin any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.61,
      "end_seconds": 96.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.27,
      "end_seconds": 100.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.43,
      "end_seconds": 104.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Nothing there no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.56,
      "end_seconds": 110.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "do you react to to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.63,
      "end_seconds": 114.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.64,
      "end_seconds": 124.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.08,
      "end_seconds": 137.65,
      "duration_seconds": 12.57,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours. I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.6,
      "end_seconds": 144.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.84,
      "end_seconds": 150.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "I take alendronate 70 milligrams once a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.76,
      "end_seconds": 167.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "So any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.47,
      "end_seconds": 189.37,
      "duration_seconds": 20.9,
      "text": "Uh, I have asthma. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. I've had thin bones for about ten years now. I've been reading about it online and it worried me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.08,
      "end_seconds": 200.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "okay, I can see asthma and thin bones in your file as well"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.24,
      "end_seconds": 206.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.77,
      "end_seconds": 209.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.41,
      "end_seconds": 213.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.79,
      "end_seconds": 230.52,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "There is bruising across the chest, the left side moves less, and the belly is tender and rigid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.47,
      "end_seconds": 238.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "all finished thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.58,
      "end_seconds": 268.71,
      "duration_seconds": 18.13,
      "text": "Having listened and examined it fits best with serious chest and abdominal injury. That's my thinking for now and it may change as we learn more. Internal bleeding is still possible. I think a trauma CT scan makes sense here for major trauma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.42,
      "end_seconds": 274.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Sorry what was I saying okay I'll do it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.47,
      "end_seconds": 286.95,
      "duration_seconds": 10.48,
      "text": "do not move I am activating the trauma team now. Let's get you seen by the trauma team I'll arrange the letter"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.62,
      "end_seconds": 289.32,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.95,
      "end_seconds": 294.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "please come and see me straight away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.12,
      "end_seconds": 295.82,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.21,
      "end_seconds": 304.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Before we finish can you repeat the plan back to me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.87,
      "end_seconds": 311.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "so uh I come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.0,
      "end_seconds": 317.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions."
